   "line": [
    "f4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The pawn to f4 completes the Four Pawns Attack — pawns on c4, d4, e4 and f4, absolute central domination. It is the most ambitious try, but it comes at the cost of development: play it carelessly and White can be crushed inside five moves.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Maximum space and lagging development are two sides of one coin — the Four Pawns must be handled precisely.",
   "plans": "Hold the centre together and catch up in development."
