   "line": [
    "Nf3"
   ],
   "spoken": "Now the knight comes to f3. With enough pieces out, the pin by the bishop on g4 has lost its sting, so it is time to finish developing and think about castling.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "A pin is only dangerous while you're underdeveloped — once you can meet it, ignore it and develop.",
   "plans": "Castle and turn to the attack."
